          <td colspan="2" height="30" background="newsheader.jpg"><font face="Times New Roman" size="4"><b><font size="5">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Another SoF  Dual epic nite!</font></b></font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr bgcolor="#330033"> 
          <td width="60%"><font size="2"><i><font face="Verdana">by <A href="javascript:createWindow('memberdetails.asp?id=33','profile','scrollbars,width=550,height=500')"><font color=yellow>Kayel </font></a></font></i></font></td>
          <td width="40%"> 
            <div align="right"><font size="2"><b>Posted: 11/30/01 1:25:14 AM</b></font></div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td colspan="2">
<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>SoF again visited the Plane of Fear today in search of epic drops.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">After a rocky start to PoF involving about an hour of CR and rebreak our PoF clearing was off to a resoundingly successful start.  We're still mid raid but I'll post the details so far:<br><br>Grats to:<br><br>Xasax on his:<br><br>Shiverback-hide Wristbands <br>Races: HUM IKS - Classes: MNK (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 4 - Wt: 0.1 - Slot: wrists<br>Attributes: DEX+5 AGI+5 STA+5 SV POISON+5 SV DISEASE+5 <br><br><br><br>Mistreaver on his:<br><br>Umbral Platemail Greaves <br>Races: DEF HUM OGR TRL - Classes: SHD (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 17 - Wt: 5.6 - Slot: legs<br>Attributes: AGI+5 WIS+5 SV POISON+13 <br><br><br><br>Shaiela and Ienami....Iennamii... on your:<br><br>Carmine Sleeves <br>Races: DEF ERU GNM HIE HUM - Classes: WIZ (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 4 - Wt: 0.4 - Slot: arms<br>Attributes: INT+7 HP+20 SV FIRE+10 <br><br><br><br>Sadly, sometimes we don't need this, so here is the list of ROTS:<br><br>Eyerazzia X 2<br>Races: ALL - Classes: ROG (LORE - MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: Damage: 10 - Dly: 24 - Wt: 2.5 - Type: piercing - Damage Per Second: 8.75<br>Attributes: DEX+5 STA+4 <br><br>Blighted Sleeves <br>Races: DEF ERU GNM HUM - Classes: NEC (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 5 - Wt: 0.4 - Slot: arms<br>Attributes: INT+7 HP+15 SV FIRE+10 <br><br>Fluxbladed Axe <br>Races: ALL - Classes: RNG (LORE - MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: Damage: 7 - Dly: 22 - Wt: 3 - Type: 1hs - Damage Per Second: 6.82<br>Attributes: STR+5 STA+4 <br>Effect: Chaos Flux (150 DD)<br><br>Maybe that will teach a few of our 'weekend warriors' to attend their guild raids eh?  (evil grin)<br><br>That's not the big news however, we're saving that for last.  We'd like to issue formal SoF /grats out to:<br><br>FETRI on his:<br><br>STAFF OF THE FOUR <br>Classes:  Wizards<br>Races:  Humans, Erudites, Gnomes, Dark Elfs, High Elfs<br>Type: 1H Blunt Damage: 20 Delay: 30<br>Stats:  +100 MANA +25 INT +10 STR +5 DEX +10 STA +10 SV COLD +5 SV DISEASE +10 SV FIRE +10 SV MAGIC +5 SV POISON<br>Effect:  Barrier of Force   <br><br><br><br>Further, after something like 160 days played on his lvl 60 Paladin, it is with EXTREME pride and happiness that we congratulation ODOM on his:<br><br>Fiery Defender <br>Races: ALL - Classes: PAL (LORE - MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: Damage: 35 - Dly: 40 - Wt: 0.1 - Type: 2hs - Damage Per Second: 17.75<br>Attributes: AC+15 STR+20 STA+10 WIS+15 HP+70 MANA+30 SV POISON+10 SV DISEASE+10 SV COLD+10 SV FIRE+10 SV MAGIC+10 <br>Effect: Holy Shock (Fire based, 150 DD + Stun)<br><br>Thanks to the clerics for an awesome night's work, Borgir for pulling, Odom for tanking, the chanters for being gods at what they do, and our raid invites including Greever and Maldar.  I'm sure I'm missing someone but it's late.  ;)<br><br>/salute                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              </font>
</td>
